{"v":4,"catch":"這場戰鬥從你帶著槍進入戰場開始！","desc":"《ROLLING THUNDER》是 NAMCO（BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc.) 於 1986 年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制英雄（codename: ALBATROSS）並滲透到 GELDRA 秘密社團的秘密基地，因為他們密謀統治全球。\n以聰明的英雄為首，體驗一場艱苦卓絕的冒險。\n此遊戲包含三個版本，每個版本的內容略有不同。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-03-17","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2dbe19b31895f599171a0d03ddeffeea925f617eacaea5a20c66e58e4671515.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1db1e78be84945a5ba0342adec56cb044859040e42abd28a7a828a9da2e4f29.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8cf7e469a78bf87ed93d958ca7c8600c33b2a17b13f373748d9cb8c741572ab6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47f7a3ce4d6963ce8f033feccd5e3cccaa6f6dc694a9fc7b85edac16e4ae4feb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19fcbf020130414ab6a19b91c3a6a62524a0c13f636a03b3faf70be06d2dae90.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffe26e04864cb3416f6cc04fa7f6e5724bc1cb5f84a707c1a4043f298f9ce6bc.jpg"],"titleId":"010068401749e000","dlc":[]}